            <div xml:id="m-738bf896-60fb-475b-b54b-f56835915f0b">
              <lg xml:id="m-68e51433-1817-4502-9046-e9ab5c83229e">
                <l xml:id="m-f0f592d0-85ec-4549-9c14-888ccd0eab9c" facs="#m-a0520596-5719-4ef5-9aaa-aedacc9c83de" label="text-like">ard Sunday after the Epiphany.</l><l xml:id="m-03b8a929-2063-40b2-b0af-976fd015e35d" facs="#m-2671e1ab-b836-4f31-a2df-7effdd7810d3" label="ambiguous">491</l><l xml:id="m-945be01b-544f-4fa6-a6ae-dc93af825d8c" facs="#m-3534d1dc-bbed-482f-b672-3d21ed5988b7" label="lyrics-like">Jesus, mirátus est, et sequéntibus se! gno caelórum: filii autem regni</l><l xml:id="m-17c1c33a-d9b2-4fc5-b7a0-7f28e2fbcb8d" facs="#m-0c2eb6bb-009d-461d-ae9b-46001f2e3d6e" label="lyrics-like">ejiciéntur in ténebras exterióres:</l><l xml:id="m-3abf9168-52a6-4456-b129-9ee536cc0b9f" facs="#m-178d60b3-a437-478e-81db-a285e4d40211" label="lyrics-like">dixit : Amen dico vobis, non invéni</l><l xml:id="m-e9199de6-a775-464c-b61a-12093edc68ac" facs="#m-e84b849f-cc46-41ca-a36b-470f0e078014" label="ambiguous">tantam fidem in Israel. Dico autem</l><l xml:id="m-525c9bb9-b752-4977-bc0e-3d273d718a6e" facs="#m-54760da8-aea1-4b15-957f-7c094604b37f" label="lyrics-like">ibi erit fletus et stridor déntium. Et</l><l xml:id="m-a469d0d1-3195-4957-bc55-173c54d17b99" facs="#m-0e80c7da-cbc9-469a-8751-5fa202e1b4ce" label="lyrics-like">vobis, quod multi ab Oriénte et Oc¬</l><l xml:id="m-a9ca9124-9998-4733-a003-47a727008b9d" facs="#m-c98ce219-9c91-4adb-9d41-11ce6de6a77e" label="lyrics-like">dixit Jesus centurióni: Vade, et</l><l xml:id="m-55eae094-8535-4dfe-993d-d5a29118fabd" facs="#m-32e5a550-d1ad-464d-8ff5-45f0387d56b5" label="lyrics-like">cidénte vénient, et recúmbent cum! sicut credidisti, fiat tibi. Et sanátus</l><l xml:id="m-af1800f8-3b7c-421b-8da5-581abcbce411" facs="#m-092242d5-c4c1-4e93-94e1-5f7ff91fe321" label="ambiguous">Abraham, et Isaac, et Jacob in re- est puer in illa hora.</l><l xml:id="m-ee271049-ba03-49b8-8dae-b54794e85516" facs="#m-e27297d8-ab2c-42c3-aae0-f71eefb9f864" label="ambiguous">Credo.</l><l xml:id="m-f98c72a8-882b-42a4-ad58-0fb4efebc09d" facs="#m-d6447a5a-47c5-4c86-afaf-46b84b02961d" label="lyrics-like">Offertory. Déxtera Dómini. p. 677.</l><l xml:id="m-58b42a73-b869-4712-a510-d45088d6c035" facs="#m-8bb80563-5d65-4d0c-83a6-1a149d538835" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-770aa218-e922-445f-8079-4aeaaa53a26c" facs="#m-9a27d73f-54fa-409a-b351-e60f3da8c036" label="lyrics-like">L. Aec hóstia, Dómine quaésumus,l rum tibi córpora, mentésque san¬</l><l xml:id="m-7710c7a0-9ed4-4a12-ab64-a4b459794c38" facs="#m-5ac49479-1b5d-4650-b835-4a56dac11618" label="lyrics-like">It emúndet nostra dellcta: et adl ctificet. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-24c511ba-8178-4db0-87e1-c165c59e8a9c" facs="#m-84d138af-f728-4d9d-bd6d-621b360bf27f" label="lyrics-like">sacrificium celebrándum, subditó¬</l><l xml:id="m-01c93195-f0d8-451f-ac36-fc33906e60f0" facs="#m-981a2cdd-0d53-4d6f-8008-f9114f7f37ac" label="lyrics-like">Secret of Our Lady. Tua Dómine. p. 1268. Scret for the Church or for</l><l xml:id="m-8142b9ad-fe57-498d-a144-1c1963dc00ab" facs="#m-92732773-b6e3-41d7-85d5-3bb3753301b9" label="text-like">the Pove, p. 322.</l><l xml:id="m-968b2fd5-8dc7-4bef-b94e-32cf01b19b0a" facs="#m-c312c8ab-94a6-43f8-b041-b91b71930492" label="ambiguous">comm.</l><l xml:id="m-c46a3ceb-a057-44d0-8b4d-fcdbc0fac8ef" facs="#m-5ec6ad34-87e8-4605-be90-eba3804a5e2f" label="ambiguous">7.</l><l xml:id="m-8013d276-470e-4dba-9123-a19f65db5314" facs="#m-f4257317-d09f-40f2-beb5-9549e0ac331b" label="lyrics-like">IlIra-bán¬ tur</l><l xml:id="m-4a0b3772-c33d-4795-86fe-f18a16dfffb3" facs="#m-479a531e-5c94-4bf2-9489-bd8cd2114bde" label="lyrics-like">ómnes *de</l><l xml:id="m-b66f3e8e-38b9-42cd-b540-779c8c07d51e" facs="#m-30a4152a-c6e3-4301-bbaf-c22d7a9ca3fc" label="ambiguous">his quae pro¬</l><l xml:id="m-6240e673-7ef6-4263-947a-3b2e347d8040" facs="#m-80222018-98a6-47bd-9a6f-e694a8f7a2fa" label="ambiguous">i.</l><l xml:id="m-4f7eb649-ac6e-4cb2-be90-ceee839ae211" facs="#m-d3691549-6414-4826-8dbc-77a317359435" label="lyrics-like">cedébant de 6- re Dé¬</l><l xml:id="m-7ad83d91-7909-414e-8e28-eb661e7813bf" facs="#m-d786d1a7-a695-4502-9703-97ade66b64ad" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-ef1702b5-0790-4b67-8e1e-0c7444804441" facs="#m-8cb80ee2-ab98-4b5f-ae52-19c440c1ed2b" label="lyrics-like">Uos tantis, Dómine, largíris uti ] ctibus nos eórum veráciter aptáre</l><l xml:id="m-fd9877b8-b4f9-4278-9332-7ec74a567c87" facs="#m-cc6134b2-0c6e-41f6-86c2-01b85b168f92" label="lyrics-like">Umystériis: quaésumus; ut effé- dignéris. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-cac4f1d8-1ba4-4c15-a7ce-8c73d5f83a08" facs="#m-9adfc702-e89b-4b40-a8d9-4070babc735d" label="text-like">Postcommunion of Our Lady. Haec nos. p. 442. Postcommunion for the</l><l xml:id="m-fa75e49b-fb18-4f33-8733-3d1f2ad4672e" facs="#m-ca324dbb-f5be-4bd2-a78f-2936202d91c4" label="text-like">Church or for the Pore, p. 323</l><l xml:id="m-7b394a70-9c43-4926-8869-ef8b76e11ac5" facs="#m-fbaedf15-f021-4af1-be3a-e25f86d439d8" label="text-like">AT VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-4970bdf7-bbd9-4744-ade1-df54352a2aef" facs="#m-b046f74a-6b9f-4eb9-9c01-f5f963718be2" label="text-like">All as on Sundays during the year, p. 250.</l><l xml:id="m-ad7eb169-edde-47ce-b8eb-b87e2414bbc1" facs="#m-147f8331-9ea0-42af-9142-f5fa61514a76" label="text-like">At Magn.8</l><l xml:id="m-758dd6bf-f112-4698-ac36-2d201ac92dc5" facs="#m-41303979-098f-4414-aa32-398b51e2dc99" label="ambiguous">Ant. 1.g2</l><l xml:id="m-cd63c2c1-fd87-4705-b6e7-7b688c7e01f5" facs="#m-e22a03c8-1f51-40fc-8569-6f9dde0e0725" label="ambiguous">D</l><l xml:id="m-87dd6301-7c9c-4713-a701-831f65250c00" facs="#m-a61d47c4-f8bf-4d87-8cc9-14cfe7ae7247" label="lyrics-like">Omine,“ si tu vis, pótes me mundá-re:</l><l xml:id="m-2be2485e-76b6-4784-81bc-9be8b51545c1" facs="#m-8dd8b977-a578-4ffc-8bca-225d2c99cdfd" label="lyrics-like">et á- it Jé-sus: Vó-lo, mundá-re. E u o u a e</l><l xml:id="m-202d126a-516f-4397-b1e9-0b5cf5578f95" facs="#m-e4bc53ca-a3c0-4775-9cea-720a5fe0d24d" label="ambiguous">Cant. Magnificat. I. g 2. p. 207.</l><l xml:id="m-cdbc58a7-21a5-4d3a-ad8f-84f08e5b936e" facs="#m-72b62693-3fa2-4568-a040-aa64c1daf8e3" label="lyrics-like">V. Dirigátur Dómine orátio méa¬</l><l xml:id="m-81e68766-23bf-4c54-b0f8-59f56a212491" facs="#m-d2333105-4532-40d9-9964-54fa2d6f045d" label="lyrics-like">R. Sicut incénsum in conspéctu túo.</l><l xml:id="m-0421c504-f7f6-49ce-bf26-04fb03b09f38" facs="#m-12391931-728c-48af-8c08-26a1d106aefc" label="lyrics-like">Prayer. Omnípotens. p. 489. Sufrage of all the Saints. p. 260.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>